+    // moe-phone: compute the ATTENTION matmuls (attn_q/k/v/output, Q4_0) on this ggml device -- "HTP0" for
+    // the Hexagon NPU, "GPUOpenCL" for the Adreno -- while the routed experts keep streaming into host
+    // memory and running on the CPU under --overlap. The expert FFN stays where the streaming engine can
+    // hide flash I/O behind it; only the dense attention block moves. Empty = everything on the CPU.
